WEBVTT

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:08.600
Next stop is Tennozu Isle.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.070
Huh, what could that be?

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.310
Morning, Aoyama-kun.

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:49.270
Morning!

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:55.610
Aoyama-kun...

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:56.940
Yes?

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:05.290
Uhm, I just wanna say... I’m really happy
that you are the Blue Knight.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:09.540
And...

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.120
Are you free after school today?

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:15.090
Yes, why?

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:19.830
Aoyama-kun, everyone from Café Mew Mew...

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:23.680
...wants to welcome you as a new ally of the Mew Mew.

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:26.890
That’s why, so would you
come with me?

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:29.060
Or not?

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:33.680
Last time, in order to save you...

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:34.570
Huh?

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:37.820
You see, I don’t want you to fight!

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:40.370
I really don’t want you to!

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.380
You don’t-wanna become a member of Mew Mew?

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.790
That’s not it!

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:57.960
<i>Ichigo...</i>

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:02.350
<i>Ichigo...?</i>

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.100
<i>Ichigo!</i>

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:10.200
That dream again.

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:19.320
I’m going now!

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:35.490
Ichigo, you’re late, yes late!

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:37.880
I know!

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:41.210
Being late is a no-no,
even as love-struck as you are.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:43.090
But~!

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:47.930
I’m in love~! Love~! LOVE~!

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:57.360
It doesn’t work.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:04.770
It might be really difficult to find the reason why Omotesando turned into a forest.

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:08.080
Are we sure that it was influenced by a Mew Aqua?

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:10.860
That is a good question.

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:13.000
There was no Mew Aqua around there.

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:17.620
We received an energy response from the center...

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:20.510
But we can’t say what it actually was.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:23.830
Anyway, we can only try to analyze it more for now.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:24.710
Yes.

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:35.000
Really strange. Just what is this energy?

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:39.100
Hey, I wonder where Quiche went...

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:43.150
I fear my present method of analyzing is no good.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.660
Hey, are you listening to me?

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:50.360
I don’t care about someone who was
sent into exile by Deep Blue-sama.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:51.120
Leave him alone.

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:54.130
Do you really mean that?

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:57.960
Deep Blue-sama!

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:02.950
What about the Mew Aqua?

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:03.930
We’ll have it soon.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:04.580
You’re late!

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:05.590
My apologies.

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:13.470
I can feel it... The time of my full awakening draws near.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:18.600
You need to get a hold of the Mew Aqua soon!

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:24.970
If you fail, people on your
planet will die.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:28.810
Geez, easy for him to say.

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:30.450
What’s that?

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:40.950
Ehhh?

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:42.040
A baby?

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:46.300
Yes, Moe has a little sister now!

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:51.770
Wow! That’s a pretty big age difference.

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:55.400
Yup! She’s so happy now!

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:58.860
So she went home already, saying
she has to help her mother.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:02.820
I see. Moe has a sister now...

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:08.240
A baby, huh? Ours should be cute, eh? Ohohoho.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:14.360
Speaking of “good news,” is there any good news about Aoyama-kun and you, Ichigo?

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:18.750
Eh, nothing really. We’ve never
done “such a thing”... not yet...

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.700
What are you talking about?

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:23.420
I was just asking if you gave him
your valentine chocolate.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:27.200
Ah, chocolate! Yeah, I suppose...

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:27.960
Yo!

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.300
Ok then, I’m going now.

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:36.440
Bye!

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:37.930
Bye!

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:42.890
Aoyama-kun, uhm...

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:43.680
Yes?

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:47.360
Thanks for last time.
I was really happy.

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:51.190
Uhm well...

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:54.330
...are you free now?

00:05:57.530 --> 00:06:00.810
Aoyama-kun, everyone from Café Mew Mew

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:04.200
...wants to welcome you as a new ally of the Mew Mew.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:07.260
So, would you come with me?

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:08.880
Or not?

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:15.930
Aoyama-kun?

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.600
Aoyama kun, is something wrong?

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:25.550
No no, I’m fine.
Of course I’ll come along, gladly.

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:27.150
Yay!

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:37.870
Ehhh... May I introduce Aoyama Masaya-kun?

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.440
Good day!

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:42.030
There’s not really any need to introduce him, you know.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:46.200
Y-Yes... So, I... I mean, you know,

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:50.130
he’s one of the Mew Mew members now.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.600
Welcome, Aoyama-oniichan!

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:56.540
Aoyama-san is the Blue Knight.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:59.020
He will provide Mew Mew
with new power.

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:01.600
Besides,

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:08.870
he’s in super-duper love with Ichigo-oneechan!

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:18.140
Ichigo-san, you don’t need to hide this anymore.

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:21.200
Well, don’t be blinded by love.

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:26.050
We have the important job of protecting the Earth, after all.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:28.200
I know that!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:32.000
Ok, let me do this formally:
I’m Aoyama Masaya.

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:38.270
I’m not sure how much I can help you, but I’ll do my best. I’m glad to work with you.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:41.300
You’re glad to work with us!

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.860
Ah, Shirogane!

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:47.690
I’m Shirogane Ryou.

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:50.030
I’m the leader of the Mew Project.

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:53.530
Try not to burden the team.

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:56.730
Yes.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:00.570
Hey, hey, what the heck do you
mean by “burden the team”?

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.500
Calm down, Ichigo.

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:03.540
Hey, love-blind girl!

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:06.960
Before complaining, get rid of those ears and tail!

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:11.830
Sure, I appreciate his ability to fight.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:15.710
The question is how well you work as a team.

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:19.140
If your teamwork is bad, having him
will burden the whole team!

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:21.710
That won’t happen!

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.850
It will be perfect teamwork!

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:27.480
Hey, why all of sudden...

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:30.940
This battle is about the fate of the Earth.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:34.230
I don’t want anyone to join us without taking it seriously.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:35.610
Are you prepared?

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:38.530
Yes! Of course!

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:40.610
He’s so cool!

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:41.540
Alright then.

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.030
Everyone.

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:44.500
Ah, Aoyama-san.

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:46.870
Nice to meet you.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:47.910
Nice to meet you, too.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:53.170
Everyone, please go to the basement.
Aoyama-san, you too please.

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:57.290
<i>This video, taken yesterday
near Tennozu Isle,</i>

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:00.970
<i>shows the luminous phenomenon
around Sumida River.</i>

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:05.340
<i>As you can see, quite a strong light
is emitted from the ground,</i>

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:09.150
<i>but no damage or effects on the surrounding
area have been reported so far.</i>

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:10.690
<i>Now...</i>

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:16.610
Last night we received a slight Mew
Aqua signal at the same time.

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:21.770
I hope its not another false signal.

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:24.580
Last time we didn’t find
a Mew Aqua either.

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.490
Yet, it’s probably worth checking out.

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:31.050
That luminous phenomenon is not anything normal.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.300
Tokyo Mew Mew! Go!

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.260
Everyone, let’s go!

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:37.760
Join us, Aoyama-kun!

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:40.010
Yes.

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:42.470
Let’s go!

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:42.470
Roger!

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:48.930
Is it really Ok to see him as an ally?

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:50.400
What do you mean?

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:54.200
I’m worrying about
the same thing as you.

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:59.640
What could that mean?

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:02.200
Man, Zakuro is surprisingly smart as always...

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:04.950
No, it’s nothing.

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:07.860
Keiichirou, we’re going out too.

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:10.100
We don’t know what might happen.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:10.770
Roger.

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:29.380
It seems nothing is going on.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:31.520
It’s really quiet.

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.220
Bu-Ling-san, what are you doing?

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:38.980
That’s dangerous, Bu-Ling.

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:44.060
Bu-Ling-san!

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.780
Hey, are you Ok?

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:49.830
This is great!

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:55.750
This water is so clean! It’s mineral water!

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.330
No way.

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:00.580
That kind of water would hurt your stomach.

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:01.720
Hey, you guys!

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:03.680
What are you fooling around for?

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:07.640
It’s true! My nose is right!

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:16.230
Bu-Ling-san is right.
The water quality is extremely high.

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:19.560
So is it influenced by a Mew Aqua?

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:23.030
No, to clearly say that, I have to
investigate it more closely.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.630
Same thing as last night.

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:37.090
No, it might be more than that.

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:55.090
That’s...

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:57.750
The rainbow-colored light again.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:58.900
Just what happened there?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:05.810
I can’t name a specific reason, but first of
all we need to retrieve the Mew Aqua..

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:07.870
Since someone came to disturb us...

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:10.330
Heh, they’re nothing!

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:14.860
Pie!

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:16.910
And Taru-taru!

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:19.300
That means they came to get the Mew Aqua!

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:24.510
I won’t let them! Everyone, let’s go!
You too, Aoyama-kun, please!

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:26.470
Got it.

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.800
Mew Mew Mint...

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:35.520
Mew Mew Lettuce...

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:37.930
Mew Mew Pudding...

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:40.310
Mew Mew Pomegranate...

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:42.610
Mew Mew Strawberry...

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:45.570
METAMORPHO-SE!

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:08.920
The number of members increased, and
our courage increased 100 times!

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:11.430
We’ll be of service 100 times harder nyan~!

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:22.300
Tart, go look for the Mew Aqua!

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:23.280
Ok!

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.890
I’ll go find the Mew Aqua...!

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:30.730
Mew Lettuce, please let me do it!

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:33.330
Mew Pudding, but how are you
going to breathe under water?

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:37.580
It’ll be fine with the candy from the other day.

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:41.570
Bu-Ling-san!

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:43.170
She’s just like that. It can’t be helped.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.140
Taru-taru, wait!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:49.290
It doesn’t matter how much the number of
your allies increases, you can’t beat me!

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:51.100
Fuu shi sen! (Wind piercing fan!)

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:55.430
Everyone, run!

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:09.780
Thank you, Blue Knight...
I mean, Aoyama-kun!

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:13.290
Even when you’ve transformed,
you’re still Ichigo.

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:15.400
Thank you for saving me.

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:16.250
Don’t mention it.

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:30.430
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.400
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:57.040
It stopped.

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:59.500
I thought it would fall into the water.

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:03.000
If the water level increases,
it’s gonna be dangerous!

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:10.780
Found it!

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:14.670
Just a bit more, just a little bit...

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:17.130
I can’t let you take it!

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:19.140
Let go of me!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:21.520
I’ll punish you since
you’re being a bad boy!

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:23.310
You!

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:25.690
What are you doing?

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:33.190
That way, there won’t be an end to it.

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:34.660
Don’t give up.

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:43.210
Minto!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:50.450
I will punish you!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.750
Quit that already!

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.590
No!

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:06.900
Playtime is over!

00:16:12.390 --> 00:16:13.950
Fuu rai sen puu jin!
(Stormy thunder tornado formation!)

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:23.880
He’s using a special attack that is more
powerful than what he usually uses!

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:25.870
If that hits...

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:28.760
Ichigo!

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:45.370
Why? Why do livings things who were originally born on the same planet,

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:47.650
have to kill each other?

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:49.860
It’s called fate.

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:56.940
Nothing, it isn’t anywhere!

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:58.820
It’s just a light.

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:01.250
What does that mean?

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:03.440
Geez, I could ask you that!

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:07.670
Then why did I fight you, even putting
you in an abdominal stretch.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.200
How would I know?

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:12.130
This is called a pointless fight.

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:16.260
If you don’t know the reason why you fight,
then where is the meaning behind it?

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:21.220
In that case, it would be muuuch more
fun to be friends and play together!

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.000
Shut up!

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:26.130
There’s no point in staying here
since there’s no Mew Aqua.

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:27.650
Hey, you wait!

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.150
I’ll finish you!

00:17:31.220 --> 00:17:32.760
Aoyama-kun!

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:33.690
Sorry!

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:37.200
Reborn Lettuce Rush!

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:39.950
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:42.330
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:50.040
PuddingRings...

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:55.630
Reborn PuddingRings Inferno!

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:00.370
What the...?

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:01.930
Darn them!

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:04.050
Mew Pudding!

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:12.640
Aoyama-kun!

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:14.190
Ichigo, let’s go!

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:18.150
Then I will use it again!

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:22.910
StrawberBell!

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:28.120
Mew Strawberry, now!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:48.560
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:11.540
Amazing!

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:27.130
Pie! There was no Mew Aqua here!

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:27.810
What?

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:29.810
It wasn’t here.

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:37.530
Let’s leave, Ok?

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:45.860
Aoyama-kun!

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:47.950
Ichigo, you’re not hurt, are you?

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:51.920
<i>Ichigo, I don’t want you to fight,
I don’t want that!</i>

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:55.120
No. I’m fine!

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:57.090
Thanks!

00:19:57.490 --> 00:20:00.830
So there was no Mew Aqua again.

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:03.210
What is gonna happen from now on?

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:05.300
No one knows.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:12.430
It was just like Zakuro said.
It was another false signal.

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:15.800
Ryou, is something wrong?

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:17.980
No, it’s nothing...

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:28.340
Deep Blue-sama ordered us to kill the Blue Knight.

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:32.720
It’s such a pain how he always shows
up at the wrong moment!

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:35.260
I already know what he is doing.

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:37.560
The next plan is perfect.

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:39.900
I won’t let you do as you please!

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:44.690
Next: “The Power of Love!
I Will Protect Aoyama-kun!”

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:47.190
What is this “power of love”? I don’t get it.

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:50.820
That’s... too embarrassing to explain.

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:53.370
Well, SORRY if it makes you feel embarrassed!!
